msgid ""
"Following the syntax specifications in :rfc:`1808`, :func:`!urlsplit` "
"recognizes a netloc only if it is properly introduced by '//'.  Otherwise "
"the input is presumed to be a relative URL and thus to start with a path "
"component."
msgstr ""

